# Keep everything in this Plugin byte-stable.
#
# The suite reads this Plugin's own source for two static checks (no shell
# routing, no bare "asc without --page-all" fetch), and a CRLF checkout would
# change what those checks see. JSON must also stay BOM-free: the repository
# validator rejects a BOM in plugin.json.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
